
OpenClaw 2026.10.9 (f964859) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.

Usage: openclaw update cleanup [options]

Retire verified update recovery originals after acknowledging rollback loss

Options:
  --accept-history-loss            Accept loss of potentially unique session
                                   history (default: false)
  --archive-backup <directory>     Independent raw backup of selected archives
                                   and manifests
  --dry-run                        Inspect recovery metadata without writes
                                   (default: false)
  -h, --help                       Display help for command
  --include-unmanifested <path>    Explicitly select one known unmanifested
                                   original or orphan capture (repeatable)
                                   (default: [])
  --json                           Output one JSON result; never implies consent
                                   (default: false)
  --retire-session-archive <path>  Explicitly retire backed-up session history;
                                   select every target member (repeatable)
                                   (default: [])
  --yes                            Acknowledge permanent loss of the selected
                                   rollback originals (default: false)
